%; IH indication adds $300M+; Avadel synergies deliver. |\n\n- **Expected price = 0.30\u00d718 + 0.50\u00d731 + 0.20\u00d749 = $30.7**.\n- 50% CI: $26\u201345; 80% CI: $15\u201358 [Estimate].\n- Margin of Safety = (31 - 48.83)/31 = **-57% \u2192 None**.\n- Bayesian update: Prior base-rate P(success) = 55\u201365%. Takeda's positive Phase 3 (class effect) raises posterior to 60\u201365% \u2014 but market prices >80%. Prior market pricing fails the 1.5\u00d7 base-rate test.\n\n---\n\n**SECTION 4.5 \u2014 TIME HORIZON ARBITRAGE**\n\n- Market-implied horizon: the price embeds successful alixorexton launch and LUMRYZ peak by 2029\u20132030 \u2014 roughly 4\u20135 years of flawless execution priced today.\n- My horizon: 3\u20135 years. **Spread = 0\u20131.5 years**.\n- Arbitrage exists only if the market has compressed 5 years of success into today's price \u2014 the reverse of an arbitrage opportunity. No positive edge.\n\n---\n\n**SECTION 5 \u2014 CONVICTION & POSITION SIZING**\n\n- Business quality (0\u20133): 2\n- Valuation attractiveness (0\u20133): 0 (MoS deeply negative)\n- Macro alignment (0\u20133): 1 (headwind)\n- Thesis clarity (0\u20133): 2 (KPIs clear: LUMRYZ sales, LYBALVI growth, alixorexton Phase 3 readout)\n- Execution traceability (0\u20133): 2 (management track record decent; CEO transition adds risk)\n- **Conviction Score = 7/15 \u2192 Medium.**\n- Conviction decay: -1 every 6 months without catalysts confirming LUMRYZ/alixorexton path.\n- **Sizing: 0% new capital. Max allowable if held: 1\u20132% (speculative watch position only).**\n\n---\n\n**SECTION 5.5 \u2014 BEHAVIORAL & POSITIONING**\n\n- Short interest: 12.43% of float; shares short 15.0M; days to cover 5.71; MoM -16.4% [Aggregator, stale 16 days]. Short interest is high but declining \u2014 squeeze potential moderate.\n- Institutional ownership 1.1% and insider 1.41% per pack \u2014 flagged **unreliable** (likely data extraction error; real institutional ownership is typically >80% for NASDAQ 